wb-mqtt-zigbee (1.4.9) stable; urgency=medium

  * Report device availability via WB meta/error: an unreachable device gets a
    device-level error ("r" for read-only devices, "rw" when it also has writable
    controls), cleared automatically when the device is back online
  * Flag the bridge device with meta/error "rw" while zigbee2mqtt is offline/errored,
    cleared when it is back online
  * Register an MQTT Last Will so the broker flags the bridge device with meta/error
    if the service dies unexpectedly (crash/kill); cleared on restart

